{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:6A93EFD01EB1",
  "root": "u4",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 56,
      "text": "Have you ever thought of trying school away from school?",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 57,
      "end": 148,
      "text": "Not having to wake up early on weekdays, and not having to leave the comfort of your house.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 149,
      "end": 212,
      "text": "Well, it isn't all that grand and glamorous as you might think.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 213,
      "end": 369,
      "text": "Schools should not give students online classes as it limits their social life, they dont get the one on one help they need, and it is a lot of screen time.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "start": 371,
      "end": 528,
      "text": "Having a social life is important for a student, it helps build better people skills, and can help them develop friendships boosting happiness in most cases.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 529,
      "end": 646,
      "text": "This can also help them build character and to not be shy around others having benefits with how they learn in class.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 647,
      "end": 754,
      "text": "A conference on a computer doesn't have any of that or any other positive impact on a students social life.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 755,
      "end": 792,
      "text": "This only handicaps them to a screen.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 794,
      "end": 967,
      "text": "Having the one on one help in person is extremely beneficial\u00a0it allows a student to connect better with the teacher and getting questions about work answered in the process.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 968,
      "end": 1158,
      "text": "Furthermore when a student seeks a teachers assistance sometimes the conference doesnt help, and not being able to properly understand the teacher due to the distance, hurting the education.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 1159,
      "end": 1263,
      "text": "This only makes it less of a viable option, and why schools should not offer online classes to students.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 1265,
      "end": 1349,
      "text": "Lastly the amount of screen time you will spend on the computer is insanely painful.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 1350,
      "end": 1510,
      "text": "Average time at school is about eight hours, and if a student wanted to do all of his classes in that time on conference they would be aching badly in the head.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 1511,
      "end": 1617,
      "text": "This is caused by the blue light that emits from a computer and staring at it all day can cause migraines.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 1618,
      "end": 1683,
      "text": "This can hurt ones ability to properly do well in online classes.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 1684,
      "end": 1770,
      "text": "Public schools dont have this issue and it is why video conference is not that clever.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 1772,
      "end": 1868,
      "text": "Arguments to this idea say it would help kids who are sick from home get the education the need,",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "rejected",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 1869,
      "end": 1893,
      "text": "but this is wrong to do.",
      "role": "rebuttal",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u20",
      "start": 1894,
      "end": 1988,
      "text": "Kids need to rest when they are sick so they can build back the immune system and feel better.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u21",
      "start": 1989,
      "end": 2038,
      "text": "Forcing them to learn doesnt help a sick student.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u22",
      "start": 2040,
      "end": 2145,
      "text": "To conclude schools offering online classes and video conferences are not the best solution for students.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u23",
      "start": 2146,
      "end": 2299,
      "text": "It strips them of a social life, the can't get one on one help from a teacher, and causes students to have a lot of screen time on a computer conference.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
